      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "POSTHUMUS.\nNay, do not wonder at it; you are made\nRather to wonder at the things you hear\nThan to work any. Will you rhyme upon’t,\nAnd vent it for a mock’ry? Here is one:\n",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
